    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611440/extras/560d3946027513342f50f11dfe0f1163.poster.avif?t=1725976778\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611440/extras/560d3946027513342f50f11dfe0f1163.webm?t=1725976778\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1611440/extras/560d3946027513342f50f11dfe0f1163.mp4?t=1725976778\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In the colorful soundscapes of LIMYN, you rotate with the rhythm, guiding a delicate thread through a geometric maze. Each rotation, a tick in time; each transition, a note in an ever-evolving melody. Obstacles dance, enemies lurk, but you are in command.<br><br>LIMYN evokes the simple gameplay of turn-based puzzlers like Hitman GO, but with skill-based obstacles that will challenge your musical timing.<br><br>Find the flow.",
